      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A Range is Count numbers evenly spaced From one To the other. The first goes from 0 to 1 turn with Ends on From Only, so the last turn is left out and copy i of the ring is turned i sixteenths; the second grows the stars from small to big round the ring, its To swung by the Oscillator. The Rotate turns the whole ring once a loop. Try the turns Range To 3, or its Ends on Both and watch the first and last star meet."
        }
      },
